king":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- v4.8.dev.custom_build [893cf5cbf]\n- Issue probably happens since, at least https://github.com/godotengine/godot/commit/251433847f85124d87f193ded4cd353e1f5bf5f5\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.8.dev (893cf5cbf) - 'Gentoo' '2.18' on Wayland - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 3 monitors - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4060 (nvidia; 595.84) - AMD Ryzen 5 5600 6-Core Processor (12 threads) - 15.54 GiB memory - PulseAudio (44100 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\nI was working in a PR until I noticed these lines:\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/9ba32b09e0dfa4a6c1b82312554894615c716cce/scene/resources/resource_format_text.cpp#L317-L321\n\nAnd I thought it was weird, because there's not a `_printerr` after the errror messages were set, so I made a very quick scene and corrupted it on purpose like this:\n```toml\n[gd_scene format=3 uid=\"uid://c7vw2u1y0q35l\"]\n\n[node name=\"CorruptScene\" type=\"Node\" unique_id=1282361756]\n\n[node name=\"Node\" type=\"Node\" parent=\".\" unique_id=1126604791]\n\n[connection signal=\"child_order_changed\" to=\".\" method=\"print_tree\"]\n```\n\nAnd tried to open in the editor. And indeed the line\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/9ba32b09e0dfa4a6c1b82312554894615c716cce/scene/resources/resource_format_text.cpp#L319\n\nNever got printed.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nsave this as scene and try to open it.\n```toml\n[gd_scene format=3 uid=\"uid://c7vw2u1y0q35l\"]\n\n[node name=\"CorruptScene\" type=\"Node\" unique_id=1282361756]\n\n[node name=\"Node\" type=\"Node\" parent=\".\" unique_id=1126604791]\n\n[connection signal=\"child_order_changed\" to=\".\" method=\"print_tree\"]\n```\n\nThe only message that shows is:\n```\nERROR: Failed loading resource: res://corrupt_scene.tscn.\n```\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nn/a","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https: